WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.609
Kuznetsov's rationality conjecture fails.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.177
Kuznetsov predicted a cubic fourfold is rational

3
00:00:06.177 --> 00:00:09.153
exactly when its K3 category is geometric.

4
00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:12.021
Assume it is rational, count K3 pieces

5
00:00:12.021 --> 00:00:14.343
two different ways, and the counts disagree.

6
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.521
Claimed: most such cubics are irrational anyway.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.180
No Lean proof yet.
